index lot: open
  note "lots of fund units under PIT-8; a key's text sorts in acquisition order within its account, the order first in first out takes (PIT-8 .3)"

index sale: open
  note "sales of fund units under PIT-8; a key's text sorts in the order of the sales within each account"

input lot_place[l in lot]: key place question "In which holding is this lot?"

input lot_on[l in lot]: date question "On which day was this lot acquired (PIT-8 .2: a gifted lot on the day of the gift)?"

input lot_held_from[l in lot]: date question "From which day does this lot's holding count (PIT-8 .6: a gifted lot from the day the giver acquired it)?"

input lot_units[l in lot]: num fund_u question "How many units does this lot hold?"

input lot_paid[l in lot]: money DUK question "What was paid for this lot, with the purchase fee (PIT-8 .2)?"

input lot_gifted[l in lot]: bool question "Was this lot acquired by gift or inheritance (PIT-8 .2)?"

input lot_reported[l in lot]: money DUK question "What cost basis did the transferring broker report for this lot (A-D21)?"

input sale_place[s in sale]: key place question "From which holding were the units sold?"

input sale_on[s in sale]: date question "On which day were the units sold?"

input sale_units[s in sale]: num fund_u question "How many units were sold?"

input sale_px[s in sale]: num DUK/fund_u question "At what price per unit were they sold?"

input sale_fee[s in sale]: money DUK question "What fee was taken on the sale?"

